@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
title What-if branch: from recorded prefix to candidate

start
:prepareWhatIfReplay
(validate source map, recompile,
check bytecode + manifest);
:Build checkpoint
GhostFlow/replay-prefix-checkpoint-v1;
:branch({ branchId, runId, synthetic });
:Fresh runtime replays the prefix
and verifies the outcome digest;
:Apply explicit synthetic values;
if (Every required input/sample\npresent at every future frame?) then (yes)
  :Execute future frames
(actual portable core);
  :Return candidate + receipts
(recorded / synthetic labels);
else (no)
  :Return status 'missing-input'
(missing names and logical times,
no branch frames executed);
endif
stop
@enduml
